p></div></div><div class=\"kb-col\"><div class=\"kb-card\"><div class=\"kb-step\">2</div><h3>Moisturise lightly</h3><p>A thin layer of aftercare balm two or three times a day. Less is more.</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-col\"><div class=\"kb-card\"><div class=\"kb-step\">3</div><h3>Hands off</h3><p>No picking, no swimming, no sunbeds while it heals.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"kb-section kb-soft\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><div class=\"kb-narrow\"><h2 class=\"kb-center\">Questions</h2><details class=\"kb-faq\"><summary>Does it hurt?</summary><p>A bit — but most people find it much easier than they expected. We will go at your pace.</p></details><details class=\"kb-faq\"><summary>How much is a deposit?</summary><p>Deposits are £50 and come off the final price.</p></details><details class=\"kb-faq\"><summary>What age do I need to be?</summary><p>You must be 18 or over and bring photo ID. No exceptions.</p></details></div></div></section><footer class=\"kb-footer\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><div class=\"kb-row\" style=\"--kb-cols:3\"><div class=\"kb-col\"><b>Inkwell Tattoo</b><p>Custom tattoos by appointment. Over 18s only.</p></div><div class=\"kb-col\"><nav data-kb=\"menu\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a></nav></div><div class=\"kb-col\"><p>27 Canal Street, Yourtown, AB4 5LM<br><a href=\"tel:+441632960105\">01632 960105</a><br><a href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">hello@example.com</a></p></div></div></div></footer>"},{"id":"p-booking","name":"Booking","html":"<header class=\"kb-header\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><a class=\"kb-brand\" href=\"/\">Inkwell Tattoo</a><nav data-kb=\"menu\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a></nav></div></header><section class=\"kb-section kb-dark kb-center\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><span class=\"kb-eyebrow\">Get inked</span><h1>Request a booking</h1><p class=\"kb-lead\">Email your idea, rough size, placement and any reference images.</p></div></section><section class=\"kb-section\"><div class=\"kb-container\"><div class=\"kb